{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Long Live Caesar",
    "steam_appid": 1353350,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1353350/extras/8f29b3008e15d4ae9543b44a5a261e24.avif?t=1734382847\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Long Live Caesar is a real-time and turn-based strategy/RPG/brain-twister in which you play Gaius Julius Caesar, who must uncover all conspirators in the Senate, Magistrate, and Legion. Dark days are coming to the Republic - senators weave intrigues, the army will rebel, and the Roman citizens expect strong-willed decisions from you. Can you resist the impending threat and save Rome?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1353350/extras/5561cb18282abb3ec13267f59c14695c.avif?t=1734382847\" data-has-big /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Famous historical characters of Caesar`s era can help or oppose you in that trouble. Be careful. Can you unite each of them under the SPQR banner?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1353350/extras/94cf3a61462c028965c2c86522ba3b11.avif?t=1734382847\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Make your decisions wisely, reveal enemies, and reward friends. Remember, only you can determine Caesar's fate. Rewrite history with Long Live Caesar!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1353350/extras/5bc649e7e1ee046ffa8719fb85faf9e1.avif?t=1734382847\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">* Detective, Strategy, RPG, and brain-twister in one game. And all of it - in Ancient Rome!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">* Exorbitant level of juicy pixel violence</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">* Roles of the conspirators are randomly distributed at the beginning of each game, which makes each passage unique</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">* Many historical (and not so much) events will give you the definition of replayability</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">* Every decision is unconditional and irrevocable. You can't reload to your last step. You should meet them face-to-face</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">* Black humor and references to some modern pop-culture personalities</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">* Pixel Graphics and an atmospheric soundtrack that brings you back to the 90s</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1353350/extras/8f29b3008e15d4ae9543b44a5a261e24.avif?t=1734382847\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Long Live Caesar is a real-time and turn-based strategy/RPG/brain-twister in which you play Gaius Julius Caesar, who must uncover all conspirators in the Senate, Magistrate, and Legion. Dark days are coming to the Republic - senators weave intrigues, the army will rebel, and the Roman citizens expect strong-willed decisions from you. Can you resist the impending threat and save Rome?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1353350/extras/5561cb18282abb3ec13267f59c14695c.avif?t=1734382847\" data-has-big /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Famous historical characters of Caesar`s era can help or oppose you in that trouble. Be careful. Can you unite each of them under the SPQR banner?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1353350/extras/94cf3a61462c028965c2c86522ba3b11.avif?t=1734382847\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Make your decisions wisely, reveal enemies, and reward friends. Remember, only you can determine Caesar's fate. Rewrite history with Long Live Caesar!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1353350/extras/5bc649e7e1ee046ffa8719fb85faf9e1.avif?t=1734382847\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">* Detective, Strategy, RPG, and brain-twister in one game. And all of it - in Ancient Rome!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">* Exorbitant level of juicy pixel violence</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">* Roles of the conspirators are randomly distributed at the beginning of each game, which makes each passage unique</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">* Many historical (and not so much) events will give you the definition of replayability</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">* Every decision is unconditional and irrevocable. You can't reload to your last step. You should meet them face-to-face</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">* Black humor and references to some modern pop-culture personalities</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">* Pixel Graphics and an atmospheric soundtrack that brings you back to the 90s</p>",
    "short_description": "44 BC. Caesar, the dictator of Rome, discovers that the threat of conspiracy comes from the people closest to him. Can you resist the impending danger and rewrite history?",
